        <mxCell id="G-5QPUfqL1SK4y8-JJGO-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mission Objectives&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Create those classes and put them in the specific directory.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Make the certain methods of these classes to do the following ordered actions:-&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2.1. Capture Packet from a certain VLAN/Port.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2.2. Serialise the packet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2.3. Send to the decision maker (Session generator module) using internet sockets.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2.4. If allowed from the verdict results, send to a certain port determined by the verdict machine.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. After finishing all what should be done, test the module against another module like it.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="520" x="-1030" y="640" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="G-5QPUfqL1SK4y8-JJGO-2" edge="1" parent="1" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;" value="">
          <mxGeometry height="50" relative="1" width="50" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="-435" y="175" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="-360" y="175" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="G-5QPUfqL1SK4y8-JJGO-3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Specialisation/Inheritance" vertex="1">
